  "bio": {
    "eyebrow": "About Dr Ma",
    "heading_lead": "Meet",
    "heading_warm": "Dr Ma.",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Dr Anita Ma (MED0002583017) completed her medical degree at Western Sydney University and holds a Graduate Certificate in Child Health through the Sydney Children's Hospitals Network. She has worked in several hospitals across Sydney, gaining experience in various areas of medicine, including Obstetrics and Gynaecology, Paediatrics, and Palliative Care.",
      "She provides compassionate, holistic care to all her patients. Anita's special interests include women's health and children's health."
    ]
  },
